{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《Pingo》是一款專為學生而設的個人化溫習夥伴，適合準備學校期末考、大學測驗、專業認證或公開考試的使用者。它會根據考試日期與溫習習慣提供每日建議，配合放鬆技巧減輕考試壓力，並以無廣告、毋須登入的專注環境陪伴使用者溫習。原價 US $2.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>核心功能</h2>\n<p>Pingo 會根據考試日期、準備進度與溫習習慣，提供個人化每日學習建議。內置智能閃卡、間隔重複、Pomodoro 專注計時器、溫習計劃及考試倒數，並以科學實證技巧加入引導式呼吸練習與考前平靜程序，有助減輕考試壓力、提升專注力，養成穩定而有效的溫習節奏。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-559-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-560-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-561-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-562-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-563-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1242x2688bb-564-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Pingo: Study Stress Relief</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T00:57:49.475698+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":323,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}